{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-translate#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-translate","commit":"125372285953cbd395fd331339d96fe93f8862cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-translate 是面向 DSH 的主机端插件，提供厂商参数映射命令与 JSON 修复工具。/translate 可列出厂商和规范参数，或查询厂商间的参数对应关系；fix_json 工具及自动监听器可对符合条件的 JSON 文本执行确定性修复，包括字符串转义、去除尾逗号、闭合截断结构和按 schema 补齐必填字段。只有通过约束校验的修复才会替换结果，否则保留原值。适合需跨厂商适配参数或处理工具返回的坏 JSON 的 DSH 用户。无需 API key 或外部账号，可选配置本地 Rosetta 数据文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:547-576","index.mjs:416-423","lib/rosetta.mjs:177-197","lib/fix.mjs:481-529"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-translate#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-translate","commit":"125372285953cbd395fd331339d96fe93f8862cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-translate maps model parameters across vendors and repairs malformed JSON in DSH. /translate compares vendor fields; fix_json and an automatic listener apply deterministic JSON repairs and replace results only after validation. No API key or account is needed; a local mapping file is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:547-576","index.mjs:416-423","lib/rosetta.mjs:177-197","lib/fix.mjs:481-529"]}
