{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-translate#caveat-config","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-translate","commit":"125372285953cbd395fd331339d96fe93f8862cf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-translate 使用前须知：自动修复默认启用，策略循环默认最多 8 步；可通过 repair.enabled、策略开关和 repair.maxSteps 调整。修复失败时不会替换工具结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:11-28","index.mjs:562-576"]}
